    "detailed_description": "Voxel Pirates is a simple pick-up-and-play action game where you defeat enemies with a variety of weapons in an adorably quirky fantasy world of toys.<br><br>A golden age of piracy has come upon the toy world of Voxel! Pirates roam the seas, spending their days gathering treasure. Set sail into a world of great ships, secret bases, and port towns!<br><br>[Single]<br>Become a legendary sailor!<br>Use weapons with a wide variety of effects.<br>Complete missions on both land and sea!<br><br>[Multi]<br>Playable by 2-4 players.<br>Work together to defeat giant sea monsters<br>and enemy pirate ships!<br>Experience loyalty and betrayal in player battles!<br><br>[Race Mode]<br>Take to the seas on your ship in races!<br>Smart use of items is the key to winning battles!<br>Compete for the title of best helmsman!",
